ri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312373_1363239738226092_2106854729412937022_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qMMycRRL6qEQ7kNvwHLlxwq&_nc_oc=Adph3ggwQB00iZTwquEWj3sgPnQBUTEXzDGl5A3OWCzns37RJAQgS63Rh9uoxsEeHMw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_-MqFew-24TuE0st2WIQRl6VLDg6wKVAPd0uLsufDsyQ&oe=6A395FAE"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image_02.png", "id": "1188201992987967", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295509_1188201996321300_2111120103698102006_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U7vWBqngXGUQ7kNvwF11Cs1&_nc_oc=Adrwt1M9jpRKm3wuW2BXqxsXLfMbq3bBEmfzC5fDpm_TL5IAnQDKX24Vqt_GbcFAF4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af833UKUP6dca87SStEKMLdN87f4LyNmn-nYiC7qGPNiRA&oe=6A39540A"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image_02.png", "id": "1737987487068873", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295801_1737987493735539_1039395962667216685_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iL-vYANeKHQQ7kNvwHX7oZF&_nc_oc=Adp1l-kWV8LeZ3fdnKP4DTTL5bCFjsEjCRsT_4VRWEFQpW3emWuuyoR3bnGUmFQ-a1U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8t_JOZ29qL5_1pRIAtRp6G_MV1k45C0LqZ8eBtg2xs0g&oe=6A39432B"}, {"file_name": "DodgeLasers_02.png", "id": "3637904013182167", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294007_3637904023182166_4032639804070807573_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5FZn1Ayc5Q0Q7kNvwENLl_r&_nc_oc=AdoXS1TEtkxuFBEywJxGb2dJxUzFhIPkwFRcr3oKHts32wIpToi_mZVgrSgeRugN4UA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9lFkmy2eRejhNgZwwlDpTGThcbOq2rJer3C0jRiZVOgw&oe=6A393031"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Landscape_New.png", "id": "898823102474350", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_898823109141016_4587002048357409884_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A812fb-ah-sQ7kNvwG7WZm6&_nc_oc=Adpdp_KwMKZjCkAWpkA-gYGmvX3SvybNu0GMpy9E49H2fLEVXQL8_C0Ai3J3PzbML5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af93Ym_ZtxMCMWtLKYEu_DOh6S9yUPVLXybH2FD9EoU3DQ&oe=6A392FF8"}, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Punch Bomb\nis a fast-paced 360\u00b0 action arcade game where you punch bombs away before they explode.\n\nBuilt for those who love a challenge.\n\nClimb the global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Classic Mode\nSurvive as long as you can! Punch a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, dodge dangerous laser obstacles, hit targets, and rack up huge combos.\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRace against the clock to get a high score within the time limit! Bombs no longer explode, and targets extend your time. \n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock unique cosmetics by **playing the game** and mastering its challenges. Each cosmetic has its own visual flair!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Punch bombs away from you before they explode while racking up combos, dodging dangerous laser obstacles, and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "